{"id":"n89184-3-7","stage":1,"title":"흐리다 · 浑浊","scene":"自然与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89184-3-7-1","ko":"사진이 다 흐리네.","zh":"照片都好模糊啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사진이","meaning":"照片，相片","explanation":"사진：照片，相片；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사진","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28030","senseId":"1","lemma":"사진","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다","meaning":"全，都","explanation":"다：全，都","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"1","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"흐리네.","meaning":"浑浊，浑","explanation":"흐리다：浑浊，浑；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"흐리다","audio":"/audio/d48eac7caf4431460a48.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89184","senseId":"3","lemma":"흐리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1f872b5045690a7e","term":"사진","zh":"照片，相片","audio":"/audio/1f872b5045690a7e3f16.mp3","entryId":"28030","definition":"为将事物的样子长久保存下来而用照相机拍下后在纸或电脑等上显现出的影像。","pronunciation":["사진"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"全，都","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"一点不剩或不落下而全部。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"d48eac7caf443146","term":"흐리다","zh":"浑浊，浑","audio":"/audio/d48eac7caf4431460a48.mp3","entryId":"89184","definition":"不分明或不清晰。","pronunciation":["흐리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/c930d3029ad8dc577c9a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89184-3-7-2","ko":"찍을 때 손이 떨렸나?","zh":"拍照的时候手在发抖吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"찍을","meaning":"拍，拍摄","explanation":"찍다：拍，拍摄；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"찍다","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63320","senseId":"6","lemma":"찍다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"손이","meaning":"手","explanation":"손：手；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"손","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17608","senseId":"1","lemma":"손","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"떨렸나?","meaning":"发抖，颤动","explanation":"떨리다：发抖，颤动；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"떨리다","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69293","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"e1e4a89817058245","term":"찍다","zh":"拍，拍摄","audio":"/audio/e1e4a898170582452675.mp3","entryId":"63320","definition":"用照相机照射某个物品，把其样子移动到胶片上。","pronunciation":["찍따"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"27d4fa6af704520d","term":"손","zh":"手","audio":"/audio/27d4fa6af704520dcfd6.mp3","entryId":"17608","definition":"位于手腕的末端，用于摸某物或抓某物时使用的肢体中一部分。","pronunciation":["손"]},{"id":"cc04aaccec373561","term":"떨리다","zh":"发抖，颤动","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3","entryId":"69293","definition":"身体或身体的一部分反复快速地抖动。","pronunciation":["떨리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/57babf717972053eda9d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.697,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89184","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":31,"sequenceScore":1.3504,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["照片都好模糊啊。","拍照的时候手在发抖吗？","奶奶，您哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["照片都好模糊啊。","拍照的时候手在发抖吗？","奶奶，您哪里不舒服吗？"],"answer":1}]}
